## Playwright tests with every change

Every new or changed feature ships with matching Playwright coverage in `playwright/`; see the "Playwright tests with every change" section of `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md`.

- Add or update the specs under `playwright/tests/api` and `playwright/tests/ui` in the same change, and run the affected specs before declaring it complete.
- Do not delete, disable, or weaken existing tests to make a change pass.
- This is a student capstone: implement only required behavior and avoid unnecessary complexity.

